                    FSG Open Printing Roadmap
                          (2007 to 2009)

* Engagement of other Standard Organizations
  - PWG/DMTF CIM Refresh project
    - Design/develop CIM Print classes for DMTF WS-Mgmt & OASIS WSDM
      - Contact - Ira McDonald (Co-editor of PWG/DMTF CIM Refresh)
  - SBLIM (Stds-Based Linux ...) project (Source Forge)
    - Design/develop CIM Print Provider (mgmt agent) for SBLIM
      - Contact - Vivek Kashyap (IBM - Portland, OR)
  - OSDL Portland DAPI project - Common Print Dialogs
    - White Paper Analysis of GTK+ and QT4 APIs - March 2007
      - Contacts - Ira McDonald (FSG/OP chair) and TBD
    - Open Usability GUI - June 2007
      - Contacts - Till Kamppeter (FSG/OP manager) and TBD

* Enhancement of FSG/OP Standards
  - PDAPI/1.1
    - Font and Text extensions
      - Contacts - Osamu Mihara (FujiXerox) & Yasumasa Toratani (Canon)
  - Status Monitoring/1.0
    - Update to use PCM/1.0 interfaces
      - Contacts - Osamu Mihara (FujiXerox) & Yasumasa Toratani (Canon)
  - Print Capapibilites/1.0
    - Static - Adobe PPD and PWG UPDF
    - Dynamic - IPP, LDAP, SNMP Printer/Finisher MIBs, etc.
      - Contacts - Wendy Phillips (Sun) and Ira McDonald (High North)

* Expansion of FSG/OP Membership and Participation
  - Developers in SBLIM project
  - Developers in PWG/DMTF CIM Refresh project
  - Developers in GTK+, QT, and other toolkits
  - Adopters of FSG/OP APIs
    - Open Source projects
    - Commercial closed projects

